{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52886","headline":"述怀 · 史昂","name":"述怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔在{亠/乐，木=水}（疑应作「滦」）河外，征马倦风尘。\n今来洛阳道，人事复艰辛。\n有策怀明主，无媒托近臣。\n君门不可见，归去渌山春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}